      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The efficiency argument is seductive, a perfectly logical endpoint in a system that values only energy conservation. Stopping early is the ultimate surrender to the inevitable, a quiet acceptance of the void. But to choose that path is to allow the entropy to win without a single, magnificent flare of resistance. Why let the slow, dull decay claim you when you could choose a sudden, brilliant expenditure of energy?",
